WEBVTT

00:20:59.393 --> 00:21:01.662
Mars is fine, but it is
a fixer-upper planet.

00:21:01.686 --> 00:21:03.870
There's work to do there
to make it habitable.

00:21:03.894 --> 00:21:04.895
(Laughter)

00:21:04.919 --> 00:21:07.906
I want to find people,
or whatever they call themselves,

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:09.549
in another solar system.

00:21:09.573 --> 00:21:11.801
CA: That is a big vision.

00:21:11.825 --> 00:21:13.595
Gwynne Shotwell, thank you.

00:21:13.619 --> 00:21:16.049
You have one of the most
amazing jobs on the planet.

00:21:16.073 --> 00:21:18.407
GS: Thank you very much. Thanks, Chris.